{"unit_id":"Mcd0LUO__dsh-guard-repeat-output#card-zh","repo":"Mcd0LUO/dsh-guard-repeat-output","commit":"01041b6f4d4ce183016701ecaed62a7dd6aec7f8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-guard-repeat-output 是 DSH 输出流防护插件：清洗乱码并检测 reasoning 重复崩塌，命中后丢弃尝试并重试，耗尽次数后截断收尾。/guard-cleanup 可查找并遮蔽会话中已有的重复推理。默认针对 DeepSeek 模型，适合需要控制推理循环或修复受影响会话的 DSH 用户，无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1089-1124","index.js:1216-1240","index.js:1293-1374"]}
{"unit_id":"Mcd0LUO__dsh-guard-repeat-output#card-en","repo":"Mcd0LUO/dsh-guard-repeat-output","commit":"01041b6f4d4ce183016701ecaed62a7dd6aec7f8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-guard-repeat-output guards DSH output streams. It detects repetitive reasoning and retries collapsed attempts; when retries run out, it truncates and asks the model to wrap up. /guard-cleanup can replace repetitive reasoning in a session. Targets DeepSeek by default and needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1089-1124","index.js:1216-1240","index.js:1293-1374"]}
